    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Trust Deed for a Self Managed Superannuation Fund ",
            "block_bbox": [
                314,
                52,
                884,
                85
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "FUND - Establishment and Purpose:",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                168,
                535,
                197
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. This Trust Deed is made between the Fund Member/s and the Fund Trustees (as amended in writing from time to time).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                158,
                264,
                1053,
                320
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Fund Member/s and the Fund Trustees hereby elect to establish and maintain a superannuation fund with the sole purpose of providing retirement benefits to.the Fund Member/s.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                155,
                385,
                1066,
                469
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Trustees have agreed that the Fund will be a regulated fund and that it will be conducted in line with the ATO Guidelines. In particular, the Fund will be operated and managed in accordance with the requirements of SISA, to ensure it qualifies for the concessional tax rates applicable to \"Complying Superannuation Funds.\"",
            "block_bbox": [
                154,
                537,
                1072,
                687
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. The Trustees have agreed to act on behalf of the Fund Member/s, and in the interest of the Fund. In particular, the Trustees agree:",
            "block_bbox": [
                152,
                755,
                1016,
                815
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. to act honestly in all matters concerning the Fund;",
            "block_bbox": [
                231,
                852,
                820,
                878
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. to exercise skill and diligence in managing the Fund;",
            "block_bbox": [
                229,
                914,
                851,
                940
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. to act in the best interest of all Fund Members,",
            "block_bbox": [
                228,
                977,
                784,
                1003
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. to keep the money and assets of the Fund separate from other money and.assets (for example, the personal assets of Trustees);",
            "block_bbox": [
                228,
                1041,
                1071,
                1101
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. to retain control over the Fund;",
            "block_bbox": [
                228,
                1138,
                612,
                1165
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "f. to develop and implement an investment strategy for the Fund;",
            "block_bbox": [
                229,
                1198,
                960,
                1226
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "g. not to enter into contracts or behave in a way that hinders Trustees from.performing or exercising their functions or powers;",
            "block_bbox": [
                229,
                1258,
                1056,
                1319
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "h. to allow Fund Members access to certain information regarding the Fund;",
            "block_bbox": [
                228,
                1350,
                1069,
                1377
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "i. not to access or allow others to access funds, except as provided for in this Deed; and \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                229,
                1411,
                1073,
                1468
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 14
        },
        {
            "block_label": "number",
            "block_content": "3",
            "block_bbox": [
                587,
                1650,
                598,
                1671
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": null
        }
    ],
